<graphml xmlns="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns/1.0/graphml.xsd">
  <key id="d6" for="edge" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d5" for="edge" attr.name="keywords" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d4" for="edge" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d3" for="edge" attr.name="weight" attr.type="double" />
  <key id="d2" for="node" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d1" for="node" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d0" for="node" attr.name="entity_type" attr.type="string" />
  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;ALFRED CANNAN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Alfred Cannan is a politician known for his sharp mind, quick wit, and dedication to Turkish politics, and later became the Minister for the Treasury in the Isle of Man."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0166</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ANKARA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Ankara is the location where Alfred Cannan makes his way through the corridors of the Grand National Assembly of Turkey."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0166</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GRAND NATIONAL ASSEMBLY OF TURKEY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Grand National Assembly of Turkey is the legislative body where Alfred Cannan represents Istanbul's Beyoğlu district."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0166</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ISTANBUL'S BEYOĞLU DISTRICT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Istanbul's Beyoğlu district is the constituency Alfred Cannan represents as a politician."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0166</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EMINE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Emine is the fiery leader of the opposition party in the Grand National Assembly of Turkey, known for her tough exterior but occasionally approving Alfred Cannan's interventions."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0166</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MEHMET&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Mehmet is a gentle giant from Gaziantep, known for his talent in brokering compromise and his heart of gold."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0166</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ISTIKLAL AVENUE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Istiklal Avenue is a street in Istanbul where Alfred Cannan listens to the concerns of street vendors."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0166</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GOLDEN HORN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Golden Horn is a waterway in Istanbul where Alfred Cannan listens to the concerns of fishermen."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0166</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ISLE OF MAN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Isle of Man is the location where Alfred Cannan serves as the Minister for the Treasury."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0166</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MINISTER FOR THE TREASURY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ROLE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The role of Minister for the Treasury involves overseeing the Isle of Man's financial affairs and implementing fiscal policies."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0166</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GOVERNMENT OF THE ISLE OF MAN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Government of the Isle of Man is the governing body that appointed Alfred Cannan as the Minister for the Treasury."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0166</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;IRISH SEA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Irish Sea is the body of water where the Isle of Man is situated."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0166</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TURKISH POLITICS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Turkish politics is the field in which Alfred Cannan is deeply involved, characterized by complex dynamics and his role as a politician."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0166</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FISCAL PRUDENCE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Fiscal prudence is a key attribute of Alfred Cannan's leadership as Minister for the Treasury, emphasizing careful management of finances."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0166</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;VISIONARY LEADERSHIP&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Visionary leadership is highlighted as a trait of Alfred Cannan's approach to his role as Minister for the Treasury, emphasizing innovation and forward-thinking."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0166</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HUMBLE ROOTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Humble roots refer to Alfred Cannan's early life on the Isle of Man, characterized by a strong sense of community and understanding of the local economy."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0166</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LOCAL GOVERNMENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Local government is mentioned as part of Alfred Cannan's early political involvement, indicating his experience in community organizations."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0166</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COMMUNITY ORGANIZATIONS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Community organizations are where Alfred Cannan gained early political experience, highlighting his dedication and work ethic."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0166</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;OFFICIAL GOVERNMENT RECORDS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Official government records provide evidence of Alfred Cannan's appointment as Minister for the Treasury."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0166</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NEWS ARTICLES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"News articles offer additional evidence supporting Alfred Cannan's rise to the Minister for the Treasury role."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0166</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PUBLIC STATEMENTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Public statements from the time provide further evidence of Alfred Cannan's appointment and his role as Minister for the Treasury."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0166</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MAN'S FINANCIAL SUCCESS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Man's financial success is a significant achievement or milestone in the financial domain, indicating a positive outcome or progress."&lt;SEP&gt;"Man's financial success is a significant achievement or milestone in the financial domain, indicating a positive outcome or progress.")</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0166</data>
    </node>
    <edge source="&quot;ALFRED CANNAN&quot;" target="&quot;ANKARA&quot;">
      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Alfred Cannan travels to Ankara to attend the Grand National Assembly of Turkey."</data>
      <data key="d5">"travel, political engagement"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0166</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ALFRED CANNAN&quot;" target="&quot;GRAND NATIONAL ASSEMBLY OF TURKEY&quot;">
      <data key="d3">20.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Alfred Cannan represents Istanbul's Beyoğlu district in the Grand National Assembly of Turkey."</data>
      <data key="d5">"representation, political role"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0166</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ALFRED CANNAN&quot;" target="&quot;EMINE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Alfred Cannan's interventions are met with nods of approval and occasional smiles from Emine, the leader of the opposition party."</data>
      <data key="d5">"political alliance, respect"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0166</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ALFRED CANNAN&quot;" target="&quot;MEHMET&quot;">
      <data key="d3">6.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Alfred Cannan works alongside Mehmet, a gentle giant from Gaziantep, in the Grand National Assembly of Turkey."</data>
      <data key="d5">"colleague, cooperation"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0166</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ALFRED CANNAN&quot;" target="&quot;ISTIKLAL AVENUE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Alfred Cannan listens to the concerns of street vendors on Istiklal Avenue, Istanbul."</data>
      <data key="d5">"constituent engagement, community service"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0166</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ALFRED CANNAN&quot;" target="&quot;GOLDEN HORN&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Alfred Cannan listens to the concerns of fishermen at the Golden Horn, Istanbul."</data>
      <data key="d5">"constituent engagement, community service"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0166</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ALFRED CANNAN&quot;" target="&quot;ISLE OF MAN&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Alfred Cannan serves as the Minister for the Treasury in the Isle of Man, a position he was appointed to."</data>
      <data key="d5">"appointment, political role"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0166</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ALFRED CANNAN&quot;" target="&quot;GOVERNMENT OF THE ISLE OF MAN&quot;">
      <data key="d3">10.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Government of the Isle of Man appointed Alfred Cannan as the Minister for the Treasury, entrusting him with the responsibility of overseeing the island's financial affairs."</data>
      <data key="d5">"trust, leadership"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0166</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ALFRED CANNAN&quot;" target="&quot;MINISTER FOR THE TREASURY&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"As Minister for the Treasury, Alfred Cannan shapes the Isle of Man's economic policies, demonstrating fiscal responsibility and innovative thinking."</data>
      <data key="d5">"policy-making, financial stewardship"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0166</data>
    </edge>
